border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">empero-ai/Qwythos-9B-Claude-Mythos-5-1M-GGUF</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Qwythos-9B-Claude-Mythos-5-1M-GGUF 是一款基于 9B 参数规模的微调模型，支持超长上下文（1M）处理能力。该模型采用 GGUF 量化格式，旨在优化推理效率，主要面向需要处理长文档分析、创意写作或复杂逻辑对话的本地化部署需求，能够高效运行在个人计算机硬件上。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#2 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-07-15/02-zai-org-glm-5-2.png\" alt=\"zai-org/GLM-5.2\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">zai-org/GLM-5.2</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">GLM-5.2 是 Zai 组织推出的新一代大规模语言模型，在 GLM-5 的技术框架基础上进行了迭代升级。该模型通过官方 API 平台提供服务，具备较强的通用语言理解与生成能力，适用于企业级应用、智能助手开发及复杂文本创作任务，体现了在特定技术生态下的模型性能优化。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-07-15/03-tencent-hy3.png\" alt=\"tencent/Hy3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">tencent/Hy3</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">腾讯开源的 Hy3 模型，提供中英文双语支持。作为腾讯在人工智能领域的重要布局，Hy3 在底层架构与训练数据上进行了针对性调优。该模型定位于通用语言任务处理，旨在提升模型在中文语境下的理解深度与生成准确性，适合于各种自然语言处理相关应用场景的集成与开发。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-07-15/04-conradlocke-krea2-identity-edit.png\" alt=\"conradlocke/krea2-identity-edit\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">conradlocke/krea2-identity-edit</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">krea2-identity-edit 是一款专注于图像身份编辑的专用模型。v1.1 版本在保持人物身份一致性、面部相似度及局部编辑精准度方面有显著改进，尤其适用于更换服装、人物重绘及精细化图像处理。虽然在大规模替换对象时略有局限，但其在特定属性修改和图像修复任务中表现出色。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#5 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-07-15/05-bottlecapai-thinkingcap-qwen3-6-27b.png\" alt=\"bottlecapai/ThinkingCap-Qwen3.6-27B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">bottlecapai/ThinkingCap-Qwen3.6-27B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">ThinkingCap-Qwen3.6-27B 是基于 Qwen3.6 架构构建的 270 亿参数模型。该模型由 BottleCap AI 开发，侧重于增强逻辑推理与思维链处理能力。27B 的规模在性能与资源占用之间取得了良好的平衡，适合科研探索及需要深层推理、复杂任务规划及知识密集型的专业创作场景。</p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\"><img src=\"http